You start with a $100 balance.

Enter your bet amount when prompted.

The slot machine will spin 3 random symbols (🍒, 🍋, 🍊, 🍉, ⭐, 💎).

If all 3 symbols match, you win a multiplier of your bet!

Keep playing until you win big or run out of money!

✨ Features
Random Module: Uses Python's built-in random module to randomly pick symbols.

Input Validation: Safely checks your bet to make sure it's a valid number.

Balance Tracking: Automatically updates your cash balance after every spin.
